Debug mode highlights a frontmatter field from its key to the end of its value, every line of a
value written over several lines included, but not a comment line after it.
== args
--debug
input/doc.md
== file input/doc.md
---
description: >
  Folded over
  two lines
# A comment.
title: Doc
---
# Doc
== stdout
---
«description: >»
«  Folded over»
«  two lines»
# A comment.
«title: Doc»
---
«# Doc»
== stderr
== exit 0
